### Get request to server
### Get all books

GET http://localhost:3333/books

### Get request to server
### Get 1 books

GET http://localhost:3333/books/2

### Post -> Insert a new book
###
POST http://localhost:3333/books
Content-type: application/json

{
  "title": "Educated Part 2",
  "author": "Tara Westover",
  "cost": 100.59,
  "desc": "The continuing story"
}

### Delete -> take out a new book
###
DELETE http://localhost:3333/books/4

### Put -> Insert a new book
###
PUT http://localhost:3333/books/1
Content-type: application/json

{
  "title": "All about me",
  "author": "me",
  "cost": 1000000000000.59,
  "desc": "The continuing story"
}

### Patch -> Update 1 or more fields
###
PATCH http://localhost:3333/books/1
Content-type: application/json

{
  "author": "Mr GoogAuthor",
}
